          <p class="cmp-text">Agent frameworks answer in text: chat messages, markdown, terminal logs. Even the multimodal ones put their results into the conversation as images. There is nothing to click and no window the agent can draw on. It's using a computer like old media. You read text and look at pictures.</p>
